    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney’s are delighted to present this stunning four-bedroom detached residence, ideally\r\npositioned on a private cul-de-sac avenue in the highly sought-after South Circular Road area\r\nof Limerick. \r\nThis exceptional home has been architecturally designed to create bright, spacious and\r\nversatile accommodation, with a number of particularly distinctive features throughout.\r\nPresented in absolutely turnkey condition, the property has been beautifully maintained and\r\noffers an impressive combination of contemporary living, thoughtful design and excellent\r\noutdoor space.\r\nOn entering the property, is a large and welcoming hallway, with a generous guest WC\r\nconveniently located off. The reception room is bright and well proportioned, while the\r\noutstanding open-plan kitchen, dining and living has been thoughtfully designed to provide an\r\nideal space for both everyday family living and entertaining. A particularly striking architectural\r\nfeature is the stepped area leading down from the kitchen to a charming, dedicated nook,\r\ncreating a wonderful space for relaxing, reading or simply enjoying the natural light. A large\r\nfeature window overlooks the front garden and adds to the sense of space and connection with\r\nthe outdoors.\r\nA door leads from the open-plan living area onto a raised rear patio, providing an ideal setting\r\nfor outdoor dining and relaxation. The property enjoys a private, west-facing rear garden, which\r\ncaptures excellent afternoon and evening sunshine. The garden is mature, beautifully\r\nestablished and not overlooked, creating an exceptionally private outdoor environment.\r\nThe ground floor is completed by a separate utility room, providing excellent additional storage\r\nand practical functionality. Upstairs, there are three generous double bedrooms and one single\r\nbedroom, all offering excellent proportions, together with a large family bathroom. The\r\naccommodation is particularly well suited to modern family life, with generous bedroom space\r\nand excellent flexibility.\r\nExternally, the property is approached via a cobblelock driveway, providing ample off-street\r\nparking. To the rear is a substantial, long west-facing garden with mature planting and total\r\nprivacy. The raised patio area provides an elevated vantage point over the garden, while the\r\nspace beneath offers useful additional storage. A spacious block-built storage shed also\r\nprovides excellent ancillary storage.\r\nThe location is superb, with the property enjoying the peace and privacy of a quiet cul-de-sac\r\nwhile remaining exceptionally convenient to Limerick City Centre and a wide range of\r\namenities. Mary Immaculate College, Crescent Shopping Centre, highly regarded primary and\r\nsecondary schools, restaurants, cafés, sporting facilities and leisure amenities are all within\r\neasy reach. The South Circular Road also provides excellent access to the wider Limerick road\r\nnetwork.\r\nWith its architecturally designed living accommodation, four bedrooms, exceptional open\r\nplan kitchen/living space, private west-facing mature garden, raised patio, generous off-street\r\nparking and outstanding turnkey condition, this is a truly special home. “Villa Maria”\r\nrepresents a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented, architecturally designed\r\ndetached residence in one of Limerick’s most sought-after residential locations. Viewing is\r\nhighly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space, privacy and exceptional design this\r\nwonderful property has to offer"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Porch\r\nWith sliding door entrance.\r\nEntrance Hall - 5.54m x 1.75m & 4.78m x 1.83m\r\nBeautiful and bright L-Shaped room with solid wood flooring\r\nKitchen / Dining Room - 8.32m x 3.28m\r\nLiving Room - 3.80m x 3.44m\r\nBright and spacious front room with solid wood flooring, fireplace and built in alcoves\r\n.\r\nBright and spacious open plan room, feature fitted kitchen with integrated\r\ndishwasher and fridge-freezer, hob, oven and expelair.\r\nUtility Room - 3.18m x 2.51m\r\nFitted Units\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nW.C., W.H.B., fully tiled.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.63m x 3.36m\r\nBright front double room with wood flooring.\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.12m x 3.61m\r\nBright front facing double room with wood flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.60m x 3.36m\r\nBright rear double room with wood flooring.\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.57m x 2.57m\r\nBright rear room with wood flooring and built in shelving and storage (current used\r\nas a home office).\r\nBathroom - 2.84m x 2.49m\r\nBath with shower, W.C., W.H.B., Vanity Unit, Heated town rail and fully tiled."
      },
